<p>Conjures up a bolt of cold that moves toward the target and explodes into a chilly circle of death, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">172, 231, 277, 316, 351</acronym> cold damage in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6.</acronym></p><p>Necrotic minions caught in the blast do not take damage but are instead coated with a thin layer of ice, reducing all damage they take by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 11, 16, 21, 25</acronym> for 4 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>